{"step_index":776,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T14:07:53Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-08T23:07:53+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-08T23:07:54+09:00\nShowing lines 1-120 of 654\n1: #!/usr/bin/env python3\n2: r\"\"\"\n3: run_periods_sweep_1_to_10.py\n4: ==============================================================================\n5: 2H-SiC {10-10} スラブモデルにおける周期数依存性 (1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 10 周期)\n6: 全自動実行スクリプト (バルク 1 点 SCF 先行確定 ＋ スラブ CG 構造緩和 ＋ NAS 保存)\n7: \n8: 【準拠ルール (絶対厳守)】:\n9: 1. AGENTS.md §1: スラブ緩和前の「バルク 1 点 SCF 先行確定」プロトコル\n10:    - 各周期数 N のスラブ計算前に、必ず同一原子数 (36*N 原子) の真のバルクモデル (真空 0 Å) による\n11:      Quantum ESPRESSO 1 点 SCF 計算を実施し、E_bulk および 1 原子あたりエネルギー (-443.5 eV/atom) を検証。\n12: 2. AGENTS.md §2: 元素対応 Type 1 = C (12.011), Type 2 = Si (28.085)\n13: 3. AGENTS.md §9: 最適化収束条件標準 (minimize 1.0e-6 1.0e-2 100 150)\n14: 4. AGENTS.md §10: 結晶面切断の物理的前提 (ASE surface(bulk, indices=(1,0,0), layers=N) による自然へき開面)\n15: 5. ユーザー指定 NAS 保存先: \\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\\{101_0}〇周期5Å\n16:    (各フォルダ内にスラブ緩和データおよびバルクモデル計算データを同梱)\n17: ==============================================================================\n18: \"\"\"\n19: \n20: import os\n21: import sys\n22: import re\n23: import csv\n24: import json\n25: import time\n26: import base64\n27: import shutil\n28: import datetime\n29: import subprocess\n30: import numpy as np\n31: import ase.io\n32: from ase.build import surface\n33: from ase.io.lammpsdata import write_lammps_data\n34: \n35: os.environ[\"MPLCONFIGDIR\"] = \"/tmp/matplotlib_cache_sic\"\n36: os.makedirs(\"/tmp/matplotlib_cache_sic\", exist_ok=True)\n37: \n38: import matplotlib\n39: matplotlib.use(\"Agg\")\n40: import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n41: import matplotlib.font_manager as fm\n42: import matplotlib\n<truncated 1444 bytes>\n. スラブモデルの構築 (ASE layers=N で N 周期 = 2N 層)\n77:     slab_unit = surface(bulk_cif, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=N, vacuum=None)\n78:     slab_3x3 = slab_unit * (3, 3, 1)\n79: \n80:     pos = slab_3x3.positions.copy()\n81:     z_min = float(np.min(pos[:, 2]))\n82:     z_max = float(np.max(pos[:, 2]))\n83:     thickness = z_max - z_min\n84: \n85:     # 下部真空層 = 5.0 Å, 上部真空層 = 5.0 Å (合計 10.0 Å)\n86:     pos[:, 2] = pos[:, 2] - z_min + 5.0\n87:     slab_3x3.positions = pos\n88: \n89:     cell_slab = slab_3x3.cell.copy()\n90:     cell_slab[2, 2] = thickness + 10.0\n91:     slab_3x3.cell = cell_slab\n92:     slab_3x3.pbc = [True, True, True]\n93: \n94:     # 層間距離プロファイルの検証\n95:     z_unique = np.unique(np.round(slab_3x3.positions[:, 2], 4))\n96:     diffs = [round(float(z_unique[i + 1] - z_unique[i]), 4) for i in range(len(z_unique) - 1)]\n97:     if len(diffs) > 0 and (abs(diffs[0] - 0.8881) > 0.005 or abs(diffs[-1] - 0.8881) > 0.005):\n98:         raise RuntimeError(f\"Invalid interlayer spacing profile for N={N} periods: {diffs}\")\n99: \n100:     # 2. 真のバルク基準モデル (真空 0 Å, 周期境界で弱結合 1.776 Å が接続)\n101:     bulk_pos = slab_3x3.positions.copy()\n102:     bulk_pos[:, 2] = bulk_pos[:, 2] - 5.0  # z = 0.0 Å から開始\n103:     bulk_cell = slab_3x3.cell.copy()\n104:     bulk_cell[2, 2] = N * EXACT_D_PERIOD\n105:     bulk_atoms = ase.Atoms(\n106:         symbols=slab_3x3.get_chemical_symbols(),\n107:         positions=bulk_pos,\n108:         cell=bulk_cell,\n109:         pbc=[True, True, True],\n110:     )\n111:     bulk_atoms.wrap()\n112: \n113:     return slab_3x3, bulk_atoms, thickness, diffs\n114: \n115: \n116: def run_bulk_scf(N, calc_dir, bulk_atoms):\n117:     \"\"\"【AGENTS.md §1 必須プロトコル】真のバルクモデル (36*N 原子) による 1 点 SCF 先行確定\"\"\"\n118:     natoms = len(bulk_atoms)\n119:     log(f\"--- [Period {N}] Step 1: Running True Bulk 1-Point SCF ({natoms} atoms, Lz={bulk_atoms.cell[2,2]:.4f} Å) ---\")\n120: ","truncated_fields":["content"]}
